<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT AJAX 4-1 TO REACH FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT AJAX 4-1 TO REACH FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy beat</p>
<p>Ajax of the Netherlands 4-1 in their European Cup semifinal</p>
<p>second leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Juventus won 6-2 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>Juventus - Attilio Lombardo 34, Christian Vieri 36, Nicola</p>
<p>Amoruso 80, Zinedine Zidane 82</p>
<p>Ajax - Mario Melchiot 76</p>
</text>
